WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.422
It marks what needs work, right where it is, and it never rewrites a word of your essay.

2.1
00:00:05.622 --> 00:00:08.193
Press Review, and Claude reads the whole essay.

3.1
00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:12.047
Each kind of problem gets its own mark.

4.1
00:00:12.247 --> 00:00:17.410
Contradictions are underlined in solid red, and joined by a line in the margin.

5.1
00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:22.706
Gaps in logic are wavy violet, and claims that need evidence are dotted teal.

6.1
00:00:22.906 --> 00:00:26.299
Unclear sentences are blue, and grammar slips are grey.
